 statutory warning threshold</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-request-lifetimes-and-the-statutory-warning-threshold"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-10" playOrder="10"><navLabel><text>Follow the exit through to completion</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-follow-the-exit-through-to-completion"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-11" playOrder="11"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-12" playOrder="12"><navLabel><text>Limitations</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-limitations"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-13" playOrder="13"><navLabel><text>2. French SCPI funds: the price of getting out</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-14" playOrder="14"><navLabel><text>One unit, several very different prices</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-one-unit-several-very-different-prices"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-15" playOrder="15"><navLabel><text>Four trades and their volumes</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-four-trades-and-their-volumes"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-16" playOrder="16"><navLabel><text>Primopierre: six auctions from March to August</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-primopierre-six-auctions-from-march-to-august"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-17" playOrder="17"><navLabel><text>How the order book sets the price</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-how-the-order-book-sets-the-price"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-18" playOrder="18"><navLabel><text>Property risk, debt and liquidity in the discount</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-property-risk-debt-and-liquidity-in-the-discount"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-19" playOrder="19"><navLabel><text>What a resale changes for the fund</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-what-a-resale-changes-for-the-fund"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-20" playOrder="20"><navLabel><text>T